{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0About\u00a0Magical Animals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/3925b809700190ca7d7f7224a9b0b07a.poster.avif?t=1759438017\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/3925b809700190ca7d7f7224a9b0b07a.webm?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/3925b809700190ca7d7f7224a9b0b07a.mp4?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Animals is a 1 player 3D simulation game based on the concept of the thrill of encountering powerful enemies endlessly. The main characters of the game are animals called &quot;Manima&quot; that resemble dinosaurs, plants, and more. Players take the role of trainers, working with their manima to destroy monsters and save the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Over 30 Unique &quot;Manima&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/88622c68ecb2c4eea30d78c8d7b3555e.poster.avif?t=1759438017\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/88622c68ecb2c4eea30d78c8d7b3555e.webm?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/88622c68ecb2c4eea30d78c8d7b3555e.mp4?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each manima has their own &quot;Behavior&quot; and &quot;Trait.&quot; Choose pairs that are have synergy or strategy behind them to gain an edge in battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Behavior&quot;: Which enemy is prioritized in auto battle, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Trait&quot;: High HP, fast movement speed, etc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Heaven or Hell. Defeat Means Losing Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/3d8954580cf0940bb0454e28e680ed1d.poster.avif?t=1759438017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/3d8954580cf0940bb0454e28e680ed1d.webm?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/3d8954580cf0940bb0454e28e680ed1d.mp4?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Manima's power will depend greatly depending on their equipped weapon. You can steal an enemy's weapon when you defeat them, creating a game system with an even more exciting incentive to take down your foes for stronger equipment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/d335964b65feb966dfb0805d3c5f5c52.poster.avif?t=1759438017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/d335964b65feb966dfb0805d3c5f5c52.webm?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/d335964b65feb966dfb0805d3c5f5c52.mp4?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you'll lose your own weapon if you're defeated and your foe will become even stronger. These suspenseful battles are the heart of this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Battle System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/34c43e231f991c14a7b3520805222424.poster.avif?t=1759438017\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/34c43e231f991c14a7b3520805222424.webm?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/34c43e231f991c14a7b3520805222424.mp4?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can create a party of up to five Manima and go into battle. When creating a party, you can choose between &quot;Vanguard,&quot; &quot;Center Guard,&quot; and &quot;Rearguard,&quot; which will greatly alter stats based on positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and allies will both act according to their Behavior when a battle begins. Try to find your own winning combination among the limitless combinations of Manima, Equipment, and Party order!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846440?t=1759438017","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846440?t=1759438017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/1b6b78882e4a008007a00b9e63806b1dceb42611/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759438017","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/1b6b78882e4a008007a00b9e63806b1dceb42611/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759438017","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0About\u00a0Magical Animals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/3925b809700190ca7d7f7224a9b0b07a.poster.avif?t=1759438017\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/3925b809700190ca7d7f7224a9b0b07a.webm?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/3925b809700190ca7d7f7224a9b0b07a.mp4?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Animals is a 1 player 3D simulation game based on the concept of the thrill of encountering powerful enemies endlessly. The main characters of the game are animals called &quot;Manima&quot; that resemble dinosaurs, plants, and more. Players take the role of trainers, working with their manima to destroy monsters and save the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Over 30 Unique &quot;Manima&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/88622c68ecb2c4eea30d78c8d7b3555e.poster.avif?t=1759438017\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/88622c68ecb2c4eea30d78c8d7b3555e.webm?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/88622c68ecb2c4eea30d78c8d7b3555e.mp4?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each manima has their own &quot;Behavior&quot; and &quot;Trait.&quot; Choose pairs that are have synergy or strategy behind them to gain an edge in battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Behavior&quot;: Which enemy is prioritized in auto battle, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Trait&quot;: High HP, fast movement speed, etc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Heaven or Hell. Defeat Means Losing Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/3d8954580cf0940bb0454e28e680ed1d.poster.avif?t=1759438017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/3d8954580cf0940bb0454e28e680ed1d.webm?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/3d8954580cf0940bb0454e28e680ed1d.mp4?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Manima's power will depend greatly depending on their equipped weapon. You can steal an enemy's weapon when you defeat them, creating a game system with an even more exciting incentive to take down your foes for stronger equipment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/d335964b65feb966dfb0805d3c5f5c52.poster.avif?t=1759438017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/d335964b65feb966dfb0805d3c5f5c52.webm?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/d335964b65feb966dfb0805d3c5f5c52.mp4?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you'll lose your own weapon if you're defeated and your foe will become even stronger. These suspenseful battles are the heart of this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Battle System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/34c43e231f991c14a7b3520805222424.poster.avif?t=1759438017\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/34c43e231f991c14a7b3520805222424.webm?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/extras/34c43e231f991c14a7b3520805222424.mp4?t=1759438017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can create a party of up to five Manima and go into battle. When creating a party, you can choose between &quot;Vanguard,&quot; &quot;Center Guard,&quot; and &quot;Rearguard,&quot; which will greatly alter stats based on positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and allies will both act according to their Behavior when a battle begins. Try to find your own winning combination among the limitless combinations of Manima, Equipment, and Party order!</p>","developers":[" MachHabaneroGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846440/08e8b6504749f8cfd3453f06e5e980c9a04a9b84/header.jpg?t=1759438017","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846440/89439619/8df5d06d5ce0fbb5a7286d181eda63b6272825f0/1757477709/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757651377","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846440/89439619/8df5d06d5ce0fbb5a7286d181eda63b6272825f0/1757477709/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757651377","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846440/89439619/8df5d06d5ce0fbb5a7286d181eda63b6272825f0/1757477